# Week 4 Learning Journal

## Learning Activities and Resources

This week, I learned how to set up a local WordPress development environment using LocalWP. I installed Local on my computer and created a WordPress website connected to a MySQL database. Through this process, I gained practical experience in local website development and understood how WordPress can be tested and modified before deployment to a live server.

After completing the practical task, I explored additional resources related to LocalWP and WordPress local development to strengthen my understanding of the development workflow used by professional web developers.

